comments:
@rklomp every value that is bigger then the default now is better :)
@jkellerza i'm not asking to take away all flexibility... Just to bring the flexibility **back**. 
Your arguments are almost the same of mine: not all sensors are equal. Mine crashed *probably* due to the 5 sec. requests (and combination of bad wifi in the garage), and it makes it more complicated configwise. (have to use filters... 17K values for each sensor!!)
Just don't see why the interval shouldn't be configurable **again**, but it seems that big boss @frenck didn't like that idea.
Many of the integrations have scan-intervals.... Reolink, Upnp, Syno DSM,... they all have it.  Seems more like a principled thing...
